{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.mkLatticeOpRule\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkLatticeOpRule</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rhs</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">op</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">Meta.Sym.SymM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Apply.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.BackwardRule\">Meta.Sym.BackwardRule</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Build a reusable backward rule decomposing `pre ⊑ op … s⃗` for a lattice operator. The operator's\nvalue arguments are made schematic; `rewrites` saturate the operator through its distribution and\nunfolding equalities, the terminal keyed by the reduced head fires, and any state arguments left\nover-applied by the terminal are point-framed onto the precondition. When the reduced head has no\nregistered terminal, the saturated `pre ⊑ reduced` is handed back as the sole subgoal. Throws when the\noperator neither reduces nor has a terminal, since its rule would be the identity; the operator's\n`applies?` filter keeps such shapes away from rule construction.\n\nFor `⊓`, produces `∀ a b s⃗ pre, pre ⊑ a s⃗ → pre ⊑ b s⃗ → pre ⊑ (a ⊓ b) s⃗`. For the opaque residual\n`upperAdjoint f b`, produces `∀ f b s⃗ pre, f (fun u⃗ => ⌜u⃗ = s⃗⌝ ⊓ pre) ⊑ b → pre ⊑ upperAdjoint f b s⃗`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.mkLatticeOpRule","kind":"def","line":171,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.mkLatticeOpRule","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L171-L219"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.latticeOps\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">latticeOps</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Data/HashMap/Basic.html#Std.HashMap\">Std.HashMap</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Lattice splits of the built-in connectives, keyed by operator head. `splitLatticeOp?` looks a\nhead up here. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.latticeOps","kind":"def","line":99,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.latticeOps","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L99-L102"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.builtinLatticeOps\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">builtinLatticeOps</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The built-in connective splits, whose rewrites and terminals seed every saturation. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.builtinLatticeOps","kind":"def","line":95,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.builtinLatticeOps","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L95-L97"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.snd\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">snd</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The projection `(⊥/⊤ : _ × _).fst` of an exception-postcondition tuple: reduces to the bare\n`⊥`/`⊤` via `Prod.fst_bot`/`Prod.fst_top` and the pointwise `bot_apply`/`top_apply`. `numConst := 3`\nholds the tuple operand concrete, since which rewrite fires depends on it; only the excess state\narguments go schematic. No terminal: the `⊥` residual becomes the subgoal, the `⊤` residual closes\nwith `le_top`. `applies?` declines every other operand, whose projection the rewrites cannot\nreduce. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.snd","kind":"def","line":90,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.snd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L90-L93"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.fst\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">fst</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The projection `(⊥/⊤ : _ × _).fst` of an exception-postcondition tuple: reduces to the bare\n`⊥`/`⊤` via `Prod.fst_bot`/`Prod.fst_top` and the pointwise `bot_apply`/`top_apply`. `numConst := 3`\nholds the tuple operand concrete, since which rewrite fires depends on it; only the excess state\narguments go schematic. No terminal: the `⊥` residual becomes the subgoal, the `⊤` residual closes\nwith `le_top`. `applies?` declines every other operand, whose projection the rewrites cannot\nreduce. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.fst","kind":"def","line":81,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.fst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L81-L89"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.iInf\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">iInf</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Indexed infimum `iInf`/`⨅`: distributes via `iInf_apply`, closes with `le_iInf`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.iInf","kind":"def","line":71,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.iInf","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L71-L74"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.upperAdjoint\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">upperAdjoint</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The magic-wand residual `upperAdjoint f b`: point-framed, closes with `le_upperAdjoint`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.upperAdjoint","kind":"def","line":67,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.upperAdjoint","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L67-L70"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.top\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">top</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The lattice top `⊤`: distributes via `top_apply`, closes with `le_top`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.top","kind":"def","line":64,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.top","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L64-L66"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.ofProp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">ofProp</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The pure assertion `⌜·⌝`: distributes via `ofProp_apply`, closes with the `⊤`-fixed\n`top_le_ofProp`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.ofProp","kind":"def","line":59,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.ofProp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L59-L63"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.himp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">himp</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Heyting implication `⇨`: distributes via `himp_apply`, closes with `le_himp`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.himp","kind":"def","line":56,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.himp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L56-L58"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.meet\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">meet</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The lattice meet `⊓`: distributes via `meet_apply`, closes with `le_meet`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.meet","kind":"def","line":53,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.meet","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L53-L55"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.applies?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">applies?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether the split applies to this RHS. Ops without a terminal decline shapes their rewrites\ncannot reduce. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.applies?","kind":"def","line":38,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.applies?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L38-L38"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.terminal?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">terminal?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The operator's terminal `⊑`-introduction rule, or `none` when it saturates to another operator's\nterminal. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.terminal?","kind":"def","line":35,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.terminal?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L35-L35"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.rewrites\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">rewrites</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Distribution and unfolding equalities that saturate the operator applied to state arguments. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.rewrites","kind":"def","line":32,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.rewrites","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L32-L32"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.numConst\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">numConst</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The number of leading arguments held constant during rule construction: the operator's carrier\ntype and its typeclass instances. The operands and excess state arguments after them become the\nrule's schematic parameters. `2` for a connective over a `CompleteLattice` carrier; `0` for a\nmonomorphic operator. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.numConst","kind":"def","line":30,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.numConst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L30-L30"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.head\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">head</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Head constant of the operator this split decomposes. Keys the `latticeOps` table. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.head","kind":"def","line":25,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.head","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L25-L25"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.mk\"><