ding `rewrites` that saturate it, and the terminal `⊑`-introduction `terminals` that close the\nreduced form. `head` keys the split in the `latticeOps` table. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp","kind":"structure","line":20,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L20-L38"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.AbstractMVars","Lean.Meta.AppBuilder","Lean.Meta.Sym.Apply","Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Rewrite","Std.Internal.Order.Heyting"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp"}